{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>Who went before the camp of Israel.</b> In the pillar of fire." "<b>And he went behind them.</b> To melt for them the depths that had frozen in the heart of the sea before Israel as they passed, in order to turn the sea floor into mud when the Egyptians pass after them — for there was no need then for the pillar of cloud to go before Israel to guide them on the way, for the way made through the splitting of the sea was leading them." "<b>And he stood behind them.</b> Behind Israel and behind the pillar of fire."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:28.418712292Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}